  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aa41ef013c425d84d935ce09a18dc1c7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Speaker: Ite the archer
    Text: Hey, you better watch yourself. Be well prepared before heading into that
      cave.
  - Speaker: Squere
    Text: What of such danger could be scaring a warrior like you.
  - Speaker: Ite the archer
    Text: An unspeakable demon that could make any brave man, a coward in meer seconds.
      Fair travles young man. If  you ever need my assistance, just inform me. Oh
      and uhh, could you look for my brother. Hes missing. Last time I saw him he
      had pupils andone was purple. I hope he's ok...
