  lines:
  - Speaker: Queen Molvena
    Text: So, you must be the fair traveler.
  - Speaker: Queen Molvena
    Text: Wandering around this dying land...
  - Speaker: Squere
    Text: I am trying to stop the infection
  - Speaker: Queen Molvena
    Text: So I've heard
  - Speaker: Queen Molveda
    Text: My king asked for some space and quite frankley I'd like some too if you
      don't mind.
  - Speaker: Queen Molveda
    Text: So help yourself to some food in the diningroom.
