  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Speaker: Theadore
    Text: Hello Traveler. You know these lands  are dangerous right? I would recomend
      you head back where you came from.
  - Speaker: Squere
    Text: I am trained  and skilled. But thank you for your concern. I think i can
      handle myself.
  - Speaker: Theadore
    Text: Well if you shall stay, train yourself  with this Dumby right next to me.
